# Tempest Hart // Scan the Clouds (CR 715): Bot1 pays {1}{U} with Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet on turn 1 for Scan the Clouds, "Draw two cards,
# then discard two cards." The hand holds Tempest Hart and a Forest when it is cast; Bot1 draws a Plains and a Forest, discards the two
# Forests (hand: the Plains), and the card is exiled on an adventure, not put into the graveyard. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Tempest Hart from
# exile for {3}{G} (Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet, Mox Emerald, Mox Ruby) and it enters as a 3/4.

